      "image": "assets/images/68531/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 2 tablespoons olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add chicken and season with salt and pepper; cook and stir until golden brown, about 3 to 5 minutes. Transfer chicken into a bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H2NQqZXtTzV9p_-4pL9VVf2YlrY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-68531-chicken-and-peppers-with-balsamic-vinegar-ddmfs-step-2-e62877ba538a45d183caffbab11a1155.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/68531/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat remaining oil in the same skillet; stir in bell peppers and onion. Cook and stir until tender, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oRbg5IRSAlgyQwiH-oHKmQEEOi0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-68531-chicken-and-peppers-with-balsamic-vinegar-ddmfs-step-3-2d85d21db66a4bef8e39eeadf07aaf5d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/68531/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add garlic; cook and stir until fragrant. Stir in 2 tablespoons balsamic vinegar and basil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G3TAxXKGhcbDhqoiVWrn-z-o8rA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-68531-chicken-and-peppers-with-balsamic-vinegar-ddmfs-step-4-a8194fe97d0448dc9d9da769d98a83cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/68531/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add chicken back into the skillet; reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer until chicken is no longer pink and juices run clear, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
